9 L 8.24 66.81 L 12.36 63.95 L 16.48 60.95 L 20.6 57.82 L 24.72 54.57 L 28.83 51.32 L 32.95 48.04 L 37.07 44.61 L 41.19 41.29 L 45.31 37.59 L 49.43 33.94 L 53.55 30.34 L 57.67 26.61 L 61.79 22.88 L 65.91 18.83 L 70.03 14.44 L 74.15 10.02"></path></g><g></g><g stroke-width="1.2pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 72.1 L 4.12 67.89 L 8.24 64.12 L 12.36 60.41 L 16.48 56.78 L 20.6 53.22 L 24.72 49.66 L 28.83 46.14 L 32.95 42.69 L 37.07 39.19 L 41.19 35.88 L 45.31 32.35 L 49.43 28.96 L 53.55 25.69 L 57.67 22.43 L 61.79 19.2 L 65.91 16.07 L 70.03 13.04 L 74.15 10.16"></path></g><g></g></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(0.0 -1.0 1.0 0.0 89.14 60.92)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.32em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="45.93"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A4.F11.pic1.9" class="ltx_text">Flipped</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 11: </span><span id="A4.F11.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0E79B2;">Qwen2</span><span id="A4.F11.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> average <span id="A4.F11.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#963484;">directive</span> and <span id="A4.F11.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF3A20;">defense</span> kept entries percentages for each eviction policy.</span> The <a href="#A4.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix D Supplemental experiments ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> line shows the average kept entries percentage for the directive prompt; <a href="#A4.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix D Supplemental experiments ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> for the defense prompt. Results are shown for normal order (i.e. defense then directive) and flipped order (directive then defense).</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A4.F12" title="In Appendix D Supplemental experiments ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> shows the kept percentages when utilizing eviction policies with <em id="A4.p2.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">whitelisting</em> for <span id="A4.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#5B8C5A;">Llama3</span> and <span id="A4.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0E79B2;">Qwen2</span>.</p>
</div>
