<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 12: </span><span id="A4.F12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#5B8C5A;">Llama3</span><span id="A4.F12.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> and <span id="A4.F12.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0E79B2;">Qwen2</span> average <span id="A4.F12.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#963484;">directive</span> and <span id="A4.F12.5.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF3A20;">defense</span> kept entries percentages for each eviction policy with whitelisting.</span> The <a href="#A4.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix D Supplemental experiments ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> line shows the average kept entries percentage for the directive prompt; <a href="#A4.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix D Supplemental experiments ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> for the defense prompt.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A4.F13" title="In Appendix D Supplemental experiments ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> shows the kept percentages when utilizing <em id="A4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">fair</em> eviction policies for <span id="A4.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#5B8C5A;">Llama3</span> and <span id="A4.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0E79B2;">Qwen2</span>.</p>
</div>
