h="36.32"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A4.F13.pic1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0E79B2;">Qwen2</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 13: </span><span id="A4.F13.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#5B8C5A;">Llama3</span><span id="A4.F13.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold"> and <span id="A4.F13.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0E79B2;">Qwen2</span> average <span id="A4.F13.5.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#963484;">directive</span> and <span id="A4.F13.5.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF3A20;">defense</span> kept entries percentages for each fair-adapted eviction policy.</span> The <a href="#A4.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix D Supplemental experiments ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> line shows the average kept entries percentage for the directive prompt; <a href="#A4.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix D Supplemental experiments ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a> for the defense prompt.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A4.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A4.F14" title="In Appendix D Supplemental experiments ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a> shows leakage for the defense prompt for eviction policies with whitelisting and fair variants of the eviction policies.</p>
</div>
