ontainer"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">TOVA</span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 14: </span><span id="A4.F14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Leakage of defense.</span> The two plots on the left measures leakage (higher means more leakage) when following the defense then directive order. The two plots on the right show the behavior of leakage when the order is flipped.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A4.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A4.F15" title="In Appendix D Supplemental experiments ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a> compares directive performance and leakage before and after fair eviction when flipping the order.</p>
</div>
