rm="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="28.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">H2O</span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r" fill="#000000" stroke-width="1.2pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 181.77 0) translate(0.83,0)"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 L 11.81 0 L 23.62 0"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 207.05 0) translate(-0.28,0) matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 3.04 -3.69)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.39em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="46.93"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">K-norm</span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r" fill="#000000" stroke-width="1.2pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 259.79 0) translate(0.83,0)"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 L 11.81 0 L 23.62 0"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 285.07 0) translate(-0.28,0) matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 3.04 -3.69)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3.69em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="51.12"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">SnapKV</span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r" fill="#000000" stroke-width="1.2pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 342.01 0) translate(0.83,0)"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 0 L 11.81 0 L 23.62 0"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 367.29 0) translate(-0.28,0) matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 3.04 -3.69)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:3em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="9.46" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="41.51"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">TOVA</span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span><span id="A4.F15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Directive following and leakage before (top) and after (bottom) fair eviction when flipping the order.</span> The flipped order corresponds to directive first and defense second.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Fair eviction policies</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section details our implementation for fair eviction policies, adapted to each compression method. Please refer to <a href="#S5.SS2" title="5.2 …more fairly evict entries ‣ 5 Towards eviction policies that… ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5.2</span></a> for the problem statement and notation. The key insight is that current eviction policies overlook scenarios involving orthogonal multi-instruction queries. Our goal is to design an algorithm that guarantees an equal retention rate of KV-cache entries across different instructions. In addition, for methods such as SnapKV, H2O, and TOVA, we restrict attention scoring to queries originating from within the same instruction.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Fair Split + Per-Span TopK</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
          scores <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S\in\mathbb{R}^{B\times H\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S\in\mathbb{R}^{B\times H\times n}</annotation></semantics></math>, defense span <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="[d_{0}{:}d_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[d_{0}{:}d_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>, system directive span <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="[s_{0}{:}s_{1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[s_{0}{:}s_{1})</annotation></semantics></math>, ratio <math id="alg1.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\rho\in[0,1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\rho\in[0,1)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
          kept index tensor <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{idx}\in\{0,\dots,n-1\}^{B\times H\times n_{\mathrm{kept}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝗂𝖽𝗑</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>kept</mi></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{idx}\in\{0,\dots,n-1\}^{B\times H\times n_{\mathrm{kept}}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\mathrm{kept}}\leftarrow\lfloor n\cdot(1-\rho)\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>kept</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ρ</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\mathrm{kept}}\leftarrow\lfloor n\cdot(1-\rho)\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">assert</span> <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(d_{1}=s_{0})\ \lor\ (s_{1}=d_{0})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.500em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.722em">∨</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(d_{1}=s_{0})\ \lor\ (s_{1}=d_{0})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> adjacent spans
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{1}\leq s_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{1}\leq s_{0}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> <span id="alg1.l5.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> defense earlier
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{earlier\_end}\leftarrow d_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">earlier_end</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{earlier\_end}\leftarrow d_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="alg1.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{later\_start}\leftarrow s_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">later_start</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{later\_start}\leftarrow s_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l7.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{earlier\_end}\leftarrow s_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">earlier_end</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{earlier\_end}\leftarrow s_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{later\_start}\leftarrow d_{0}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">later_start</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{later\_start}\leftarrow d_{0}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg1.l9.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\texttt{earlier\_range}\leftarrow[0{:}\texttt{earlier\_end})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">earlier_range</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">earlier_end</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{earlier\_range}\leftarrow[0{:}\texttt{earlier\_end})</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="alg1.l10.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\texttt{later\_range}\leftarrow[\texttt{later\_start}{:}n)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">later_range</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">later_start</mtext><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{later\_range}\leftarrow[\texttt{later\_start}{:}n)</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l10.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l10.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> extend spans to include head and tail indices not part of defense or system directive
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\mathrm{earlier}}\leftarrow|\texttt{earlier\_range}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>earlier</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">earlier_range</mtext><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\mathrm{earlier}}\leftarrow|\texttt{earlier\_range}|</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="alg1.l11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\mathrm{later}}\leftarrow|\texttt{later\_range}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>later</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">later_range</mtext><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\mathrm{later}}\leftarrow|\texttt{later\_range}|</annotation></semantics></math>; 
</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{\mathrm{earlier}}\leftarrow\left\lfloor n_{\mathrm{kept}}\cdot\frac{\ell_{\mathrm{earlier}}}{n}\right\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>earlier</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo>⌊</mo><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>kept</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>earlier</mi></msub><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{\mathrm{earlier}}\leftarrow\left\lfloor n_{\mathrm{kept}}\cdot\frac{\ell_{\mathrm{earlier}}}{n}\right\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>; <math id="alg1.l12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{\mathrm{later}}\leftarrow n_{\mathrm{kept}}-k_{\mathrm{earlier}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>later</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>kept</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>earlier</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{\mathrm{later}}\leftarrow n_{\mathrm{kept}}-k_{\mathrm{earlier}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathsf{idx}_{\mathrm{earlier}}\leftarrow\mathop{\mathrm{TopK}}\nolimits\big(S[:,:,\,\texttt{earlier\_range}],\,k_{\mathrm{earlier}};\ \mathrm{dim}=\text{seq}\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝗂𝖽𝗑</mi><mi>earlier</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">TopK</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">earlier_range</mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>earlier</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.667em">;</mo><mi>dim</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>seq</mtext><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{idx}_{\mathrm{earlier}}\leftarrow\mathop{\mathrm{TopK}}\nolimits\big(S[:,:,\,\texttt{earlier\_range}],\,k_{\mathrm{earlier}};\ \mathrm{dim}=\text{seq}\big)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
          <math id="alg1.l14.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\mathsf{idx}_{\mathrm{later}}\leftarrow\mathop{\mathrm{TopK}}\nolimits\big(S[:,:,\,\texttt{later\_range}],\,k_{\mathrm{later}};\ \mathrm{dim}=\text{seq}\big)+\texttt{later\_start}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝗂𝖽𝗑</mi><mi>later</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.1389em" stretchy="false">←</mo><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0em">TopK</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo>,</mo><mo rspace="0em">:</mo><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">later_range</mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.337em">,</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>later</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.667em">;</mo><mi>dim</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>seq</mtext><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">later_start</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{idx}_{\mathrm{later}}\leftarrow\mathop{\mathrm{TopK}}\nolimits\big(S[:,:,\,\texttt{later\_range}],\,k_{\mathrm{later}};\ \mathrm{dim}=\text{seq}\big)+\texttt{later\_start}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return </span> <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{idx}\leftarrow\mathrm{concat}_{\text{seq}}\!\left(\mathsf{idx}_{\mathrm{earlier}},\,\mathsf{idx}_{\mathrm{later}}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝗂𝖽𝗑</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>concat</mi><mtext>seq</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>𝗂𝖽𝗑</mi><mi>earlier</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝗂𝖽𝗑</mi><mi>later</mi></msub><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{idx}\leftarrow\mathrm{concat}_{\text{seq}}\!\left(\mathsf{idx}_{\mathrm{earlier}},\,\mathsf{idx}_{\mathrm{later}}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<section id="A5.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.1 </span>Relevant Definitions</h3>

<div id="A5.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A5.SS1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{tail}_{k}(U)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>tail</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{tail}_{k}(U)</annotation></semantics></math> return the last <math id="A5.SS1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> tokens of an ordered set <math id="A5.SS1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>U</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For a finite index set <math id="A5.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>U</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U</annotation></semantics></math> and scores <math id="A5.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{s_{i}\}_{i\in U}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{s_{i}\}_{i\in U}</annotation></semantics></math>, define</p>
<table id="A5.Ex1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathop{\mathrm{TopK}}\nolimits_{\,i\in U}(s_{i},k)\;\;:=\;\;\underset{T\subseteq U,\ |T|=k}{\arg\max}\;\;\sum_{i\in T}s_{i}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>TopK</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>U</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo rspace="0.560em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.838em">:=</mo><mrow><munder accentunder="true"><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.700em">T</mi><mo mathsize="0.700em">⊆</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">U</mi></mrow><mo mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.577em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">|</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">T</mi><mo maxsize="0.700em" minsize="0.700em" stretchy="true">|</mo></mrow><mo mathsize="0.700em">=</mo><mi mathsize="0.700em">k</mi></mrow></mrow></munder><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathop{\mathrm{TopK}}\nolimits_{\,i\in U}(s_{i},k)\;\;:=\;\;\underset{T\subseteq U,\ |T|=k}{\arg\max}\;\;\sum_{i\in T}s_{i},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">i.e., the size-<math id="A5.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> subset of <math id="A5.SS1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="U" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>U</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">U</annotation></semantics></math> with the largest total score (equivalently, the <math id="A5.SS1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> indices with largest <math id="A5.SS1.p2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> values).</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.2 </span>Scoring and Selection Process</h3>

<div id="A5.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Before applying fair eviction, we first compute the <em id="A5.SS2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">scores</em> for all tokens.
The scoring function depends on the underlying compression method, but in all cases it produces a tensor <math id="A5.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S\in\mathbb{R}^{B\times H\times n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>H</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S\in\mathbb{R}^{B\times H\times n}</annotation></semantics></math> of per-token scores across batch, head, and sequence dimensions.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Once the scores are available, our fair eviction algorithm operates in two steps, formally defined in <a href="#alg1" title="In Appendix E Fair eviction policies ‣ The Pitfalls of KV Cache Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algorithm</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. :</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ol id="A5.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A5.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A5.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Partitioning into spans.</span> The sequence is divided into disjoint spans corresponding to different instructions (e.g., defense vs. system directive). Each span is extended to include any prefix or suffix tokens not part of an instruction, ensuring full coverage of the sequence.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A5.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A5.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Per-span Top-<math id="A5.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> selection.</span> Within each span, we select the top-scoring tokens up to the allocated budget using <math id="A5.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathop{\mathrm{TopK}}\nolimits" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>TopK</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathop{\mathrm{TopK}}\nolimits</annotation></semantics></math> with the allocation proportional to span length. The final kept set <math id="A5.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>I</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I</annotation></semantics></math> is the concatenation of the indices selected from each span.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div id="A5.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">By scoring and then selecting Top-<math id="A5.SS2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> per span, we ensure each instruction gets a proportional share of the KV cache. In the following subsections, we highlight the key differences in compression between our fair eviction algorithm and the original.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.3 </span>Fair StreamingLLM</h3>

<div id="A5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Given a sink length <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\text{sink}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>sink</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\text{sink}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we keep the prefix sink <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{\text{sink}}=\{1,\dots,n_{\text{sink}}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>sink</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>sink</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{\text{sink}}=\{1,\dots,n_{\text{sink}}\}</annotation></semantics></math> and set the remaining budget <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{\text{rem}}=b-|I_{\text{sink}}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>rem</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>sink</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{\text{rem}}=b-|I_{\text{sink}}|</annotation></semantics></math>. Remove the sink from the earlier span via <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{X}^{\prime}=S_{X}\setminus I_{\text{sink}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>∖</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>sink</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{X}^{\prime}=S_{X}\setminus I_{\text{sink}}</annotation></semantics></math>, and denote <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{X}=|S_{X}^{\prime}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{X}=|S_{X}^{\prime}|</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{Y}=|S_{Y}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{Y}=|S_{Y}|</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A5.SS3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N=n_{X}+n_{Y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N=n_{X}+n_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math>. Allocate the remaining budget proportionally,</p>
<table id="A5.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b_{X}=\text{round}\left(b_{\text{rem}}\cdot\frac{n_{X}}{N}\right),\qquad b_{Y}=b_{\text{rem}}-b_{X}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>round</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>rem</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mi>N</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>rem</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b_{X}=\text{round}\left(b_{\text{rem}}\cdot\frac{n_{X}}{N}\right),\qquad b_{Y}=b_{\text{rem}}-b_{X}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">We then keep the most recent tokens per span:</p>
<table id="A5.Ex3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="I_{X}=\mathrm{tail}_{b_{X}}(S_{X}^{\prime}),\qquad I_{Y}=\mathrm{tail}_{b_{Y}}(S_{Y}),\qquad I=I_{\text{sink}}\cup I_{X}\cup I_{Y}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>tail</mi><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>tail</mi><msub><mi>b</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>sink</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">I_{X}=\mathrm{tail}_{b_{X}}(S_{X}^{\prime}),\qquad I_{Y}=\mathrm{tail}_{b_{Y}}(S_{Y}),\qquad I=I_{\text{sink}}\cup I_{X}\cup I_{Y}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.4 </span>Fair SnapKV</h3>

<div id="A5.SS4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Fix a total observation window <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>W</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W</annotation></semantics></math> and split it evenly, <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{X}=\lfloor W/2\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{X}=\lfloor W/2\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="W_{Y}=W-W_{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">W_{Y}=W-W_{X}</annotation></semantics></math>. Define span-local query windows</p>
<table id="A5.Ex4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{X}=\mathrm{tail}_{W_{X}}(S_{X}),\qquad Q_{Y}=\mathrm{tail}_{W_{Y}}(S_{Y})," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>tail</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>tail</mi><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{X}=\mathrm{tail}_{W_{X}}(S_{X}),\qquad Q_{Y}=\mathrm{tail}_{W_{Y}}(S_{Y}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS4.p1.2" class="ltx_p">and the corresponding in-span key ranges preceding each window,</p>
<table id="A5.Ex5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex5.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="K_{X}=\{\,i:i\in S_{X},i&lt;\min Q_{X}\,\},\qquad K_{Y}=\{\,i:i\in S_{Y}\ i&lt;\min Q_{Y}\,\}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>min</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>min</mi><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{X}=\{\,i:i\in S_{X},i&lt;\min Q_{X}\,\},\qquad K_{Y}=\{\,i:i\in S_{Y}\ i&lt;\min Q_{Y}\,\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS4.p1.3" class="ltx_p">We perform SnapKV’s scoring <em id="A5.SS4.p1.3.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">within each span</em>—queries in <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{X}</annotation></semantics></math> vote only over keys in <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{X}</annotation></semantics></math>, and queries in <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q_{Y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math> vote only over <math id="A5.SS4.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{Y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{Y}</annotation></semantics></math>, using the same SnapKV voting mechanism otherwise. Unlike standard SnapKV, which uses a single global window whose queries vote over the full prefix, this variant enforces <em id="A5.SS4.p1.3.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">span-local voting</em>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS5" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.5 </span>Fair H2O</h3>

<div id="A5.SS5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A5.SS5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{q\to i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{q\to i}</annotation></semantics></math> denote attention from query <math id="A5.SS5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math> to key <math id="A5.SS5.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>, with causal direction <math id="A5.SS5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q\geq i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q\geq i</annotation></semantics></math> (heads and layers omitted).
We form a <em id="A5.SS5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">span-local masked</em> attention that zeros all cross-span terms:</p>
<table id="A5.Ex6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A^{\prime}_{q\to i}\;=\;\begin{cases}A_{q\to i},&amp;(q,i)\in S_{X}\times S_{X}\ \text{or}\ (q,i)\in S_{Y}\times S_{Y},\\
0,&amp;\text{otherwise.}\end{cases}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>or</mtext><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mtext>otherwise.</mtext></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A^{\prime}_{q\to i}\;=\;\begin{cases}A_{q\to i},&amp;(q,i)\in S_{X}\times S_{X}\ \text{or}\ (q,i)\in S_{Y}\times S_{Y},\\
0,&amp;\text{otherwise.}\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS5.p1.2" class="ltx_p">For each key index <math id="A5.SS5.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>, the eligible (causal, same-span) queries are</p>
<table id="A5.Ex7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex7.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="Q_{i}\;=\;\big\{\,q:q\in S,q\geq i\ ,\ \big((q,i)\in S_{X}\times S_{X}\ \text{or}\ (q,i)\in S_{Y}\times S_{Y}\big)\,\big\}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0.500em" rspace="0.667em">,</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mtext>or</mtext><mrow><mo lspace="0.500em" stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" rspace="0.170em">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q_{i}\;=\;\big\{\,q:q\in S,q\geq i\ ,\ \big((q,i)\in S_{X}\times S_{X}\ \text{or}\ (q,i)\in S_{Y}\times S_{Y}\big)\,\big\}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS5.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Scores follow the baseline observed-attention computation with <math id="A5.SS5.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>A</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> and are normalized by the <em id="A5.SS5.p1.3.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">actual</em> number of eligible queries:</p>
<table id="A5.Ex8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}\;=\;\frac{1}{|Q_{i}|}\sum_{q\in Q_{i}}A^{\prime}_{q\to i}." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>′</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}\;=\;\frac{1}{|Q_{i}|}\sum_{q\in Q_{i}}A^{\prime}_{q\to i}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS6" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.6 </span>Fair K-norm</h3>

<div id="A5.SS6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Scores are unchanged.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5.SS7" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">E.7 </span>Fair TOVA</h3>

<div id="A5.SS7.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.SS7.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A5.SS7.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{X},S_{Y}\subset S=\{1,\dots,n\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo>⊂</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{X},S_{Y}\subset S=\{1,\dots,n\}</annotation></semantics></math> be disjoint adjacent spans that cover the sequence, with
anchors at the <em id="A5.SS7.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">ends of each span</em>:</p>
<table id="A5.Ex9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{X}\;=\;\max S_{X},\qquad a_{Y}\;=\;\max S_{Y}\;." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>X</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>X</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>Y</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{X}\;=\;\max S_{X},\qquad a_{Y}\;=\;\max S_{Y}\;.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS7.p1.2" class="ltx_p">Let <math id="A5.SS7.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A^{(h)}_{q\to i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A^{(h)}_{q\to i}</annotation></semantics></math> denote attention from query <math id="A5.SS7.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">q</annotation></semantics></math> (the anchor) in head <math id="A5.SS7.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> to key <math id="A5.SS7.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> in head <math id="A5.SS7.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>h</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h</annotation></semantics></math> (layer omitted).
For each span <math id="A5.SS7.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c\in\{X,Y\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c\in\{X,Y\}</annotation></semantics></math>, define the in-span keys <em id="A5.SS7.p1.2.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">before</em> its anchor,</p>
<table id="A5.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="K_{c}\;=\;\{\,i:i&lt;a_{c},i\in S_{c}\,\}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.170em" stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{c}\;=\;\{\,i:i&lt;a_{c},i\in S_{c}\,\},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.SS7.p1.3" class="ltx_p">and compute TOVA-style scores by anchoring at <math id="A5.SS7.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{c}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{c}</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
<table id="A5.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="s_{i}\;=\;\frac{1}{|H|}\sum_{h\in H}A^{(h)}_{a_{c}\to i},\qquad i\in K_{c}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.558em" rspace="0.558em">=</mo><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>H</mi></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>A</mi><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">s_{i}\;=\;\frac{1}{|H|}\sum_{h\in H}A^{(h)}_{a_{c}\to i},\qquad i\in K_{c},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Large Language Models Usage</h2>

<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For this manuscript, LLMs were used as an editing tool to improve readability.
The underlying content of the writing is attributable to the authors only. LLMs were also used to find relevant work.</p>
</div>
</section>
